pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 500, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: 痛点 06 · 运维不足
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 56, 832, 32]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      wrap: false
      text: 运维不足：接口 Agent 化，让高频运维变成自助对话
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 96, 44, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: agent-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 122, 400, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: 接口 → Agent 接入清单
  - elementId: agent-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 144, 400, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>1. 注册工具：接口名称 / 参数 / 返回注册为 Agent 可调用的 tool</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px">2. 对话模板：为高频需求配置参数收集话术（「要查哪个时间窗？」）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px">3. 结果解释：接口返回翻译为业务语言，并附口径引用</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px">4. 兜底策略：参数缺失先追问；超出接口能力自动生成人工工单</p>
  - elementId: ops-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 282, 400, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: 运维约定
  - elementId: ops-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 304, 400, 108]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· WebUI 之外，重跑、查数、调参等高频运维都要有 Agent 对话入口</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">· 新需求交付时，先回答「能否接口化」，再回答「要不要进 Agent」</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">· 接口调用量、Agent 解决率、人工工单量纳入月度运维报告</p>
  - elementId: case-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 122, 386, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: 业务方自助场景示例
  - elementId: case1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [510, 146, 386, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: case1-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [510, 146, 3, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: case1-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [528, 156, 354, 100]
    content:
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:11px; color:$ink;"><em>「把高风险工单阈值从 0.8 调到 0.85，看看效果」</em></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><span style="font-size:10px; color:$gray;">Agent 收集参数 → 调用规则引擎沙箱接口 → 返回新旧阈值对比报告</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:10px; color:$primary;"><strong>无需改代码、无需排期，分钟级完成</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: case2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [510, 282, 386, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: case2-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [510, 282, 3, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: case2-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [528, 292, 354, 100]
    content:
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:11px; color:$ink;"><em>「按我上传的这份名单，跑一遍模型打分」</em></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><span style="font-size:10px; color:$gray;">Agent 接收文件 → 调用批量推理接口 → 返回结果下载链接</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:10px; color:$primary;"><strong>业务方按需自助，算法侧零介入</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: sample-band
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 448, 832, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: sample-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 448, 3, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: sample-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 448, 800, 36]
    content:
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:11px; color:#3A423C;"><strong>样例资产</strong>：samples/04_06_接口化与Agent化SOP.md —— 与痛点 04 共用同一份 SOP：变更走对话入口，运维也走对话入口</span></p>
  - elementId: footer-line
